{"documents":[{"entities":[{"text":"Steve Jobs","type":"PERSON"},{"text":"Apple","type":"ORGANIZATION"},{"text":"1976","type":"DATE"},{"text":"Tim Cook","type":"PERSON"},{"text":"iPhone","type":"TECHNOLOGY"},{"text":"iOS","type":"TECHNOLOGY"}],"id":"apple","relations":[{"source":"Steve Jobs","target":"Apple","type":"founded_by"},{"source":"Tim Cook","target":"Apple","type":"works_for"},{"source":"Apple","target":"iPhone","type":"developed"}],"text":"Steve Jobs founded Apple in 1976. Tim Cook works for Apple as its chief executive. Apple developed the iPhone, a smartphone that runs iOS."},{"entities":[{"text":"Larry Page","type":"PERSON"},{"text":"Sergey Brin","type":"PERSON"},{"text":"Google","type":"ORGANIZATION"},{"text":"1998","type":"DATE"},{"text":"Mountain View","type":"LOCATION"},{"text":"California","type":"LOCATION"},{"text":"PageRank","type":"TECHNOLOGY"},{"text":"YouTube","type":"ORGANIZATION"},{"text":"2006","type":"DATE"}],"id":"google","relations":[{"source":"Larry Page","target":"Google","type":"founded_by"},{"source":"Sergey Brin","target":"Google","type":"founded_by"},{"source":"Google","target":"Mountain View","type":"located_in"},{"source":"Google","target":"California","type":"located_in"},{"source":"Google","target":"PageRank","type":"developed"},{"source":"Google","target":"YouTube","type":"acquired"}],"text":"Larry Page and Sergey Brin founded Google in 1998. Google is headquartered in Mountain View, California. Google developed PageRank and later acquired YouTube in 2006."},{"entities":[{"text":"Satya Nadella","type":"PERSON"},{"text":"Hyderabad","type":"LOCATION"},{"text":"India","type":"LOCATION"},{"text":"Microsoft","type":"ORGANIZATION"},{"text":"1992","type":"DATE"},{"text":"2014","type":"DATE"},{"text":"Redmond","type":"LOCATION"},{"text":"Washington","type":"LOCATION"},{"text":"Windows","type":"TECHNOLOGY"}],"id":"microsoft","relations":[{"source":"Satya Nadella","target":"Hyderabad","type":"born_in"},{"source":"Satya Nadella","target"